james-will-2.md:1: argue/modal-ambiguous: the conclusion is read james-will-2.logic.r1 and james-will-2.logic.r1.3 with no modality; james-will-2.logic.r1.2 as what is necessary or possible: its "may" or "must" does not say which it means
